    "extraction_notes": [
      "Datasheet SHA-256 verified: f58c1f02cbbc09ac9a6e4b1564b0bfd15d125fda743b4acb239fe89e68b93ac9.",
      "No transfer characteristic (ID vs VGS) figure exists in this datasheet; typical figures provided are output characteristics, RDS(on) vs ID/VGS/Tj, normalized Vth vs Tj, body diode forward, capacitance, gate charge, power derating, SOA, and transient thermal impedance. Threshold behavior is covered by the table Vgs(th) window (0.5-1.0 V at 250 uA) and the output curve family.",
      "Curves digitized pixel-wise from a 300 dpi render with axis-frame and gridline calibration, color-separated per legend series; legend-swatch pixels excluded as outliers.",
      "Consistency check: digitized capacitance at VDS=10V (Ciss 43.1, Coss 9.4, Crss 5.7 pF) matches table typicals (43/9/6 pF).",
      "Figure 1 legend lowest curve reads VGS=1.5V at 600 dpi (legend ladder 1.5/2.5/3.5/4.5/5.5 V), even though the electrical table specifies RDS(on) at VGS=1.8V; recorded as 1.5V per the printed legend.",
      "VGS=4.5V and 5.5V output curves nearly overlap and exit the plot top (>3.2A) near VDS=0.75-0.8V; points reported only where each trace is unambiguous.",
      "Document carries no revision code or date; PDF metadata creation date is 2021-05-29.",
      "Electrical table page 2 lists two Total Gate Charge rows (1.1 nC at VGS=2.5V and 2 nC at VGS=4.5V, both VDS=10V, ID=1A)."
